>, persistent</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></small></span></li><li><span class=\"con-checklist__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">·</span></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Third-party processing of photographers' media </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">off</span><small><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Flag </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">off</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, readiness </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">off</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">. Each vendor also needs written confirmation on their own files.</span></small></span></li></ul></section><section id=\"review\" class=\"ops-section\" aria-labelledby=\"review-heading\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Waiting for review (0)\"><h2 id=\"review-heading\" class=\"ops-h2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Waiting for review (0)</span></h2><p class=\"con-note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Suggested alt text is a draft. Edit it into your own words before publishing; nothing here reaches a guest until you do.</span></p><div class=\"media-empty\" role=\"status\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">No suggestions are waiting. New uploads are described after the next index run.</span></p></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div>"
